## Decision

Rule: type or queue gain >= 0.02, no head drop > 0.01, p95 < 150.0 ms.

- A+extra: Δ type -0.009, Δ queue -0.023, Δ priority -0.001, p95 18 ms → does not qualify
- B: Δ type -0.063, Δ queue -0.239, Δ priority -0.159, p95 138 ms → does not qualify
- SVM+extra: Δ type -0.006, Δ queue +0.031, Δ priority +0.020, p95 5 ms → qualifies
- SVM-tuned+extra: Δ type -0.008, Δ queue +0.056, Δ priority +0.019, p95 6 ms → qualifies

